  <dc:creator>Nikos Baxevanis</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>.NET port of dk.brics.automaton - Project Fare is an effort to bring a DFA/NFA (finite-state automata) implementation from Java to .NET. There are quite a few implementations available in other languages today. This project aims to fill the gap in .NET.</dc:description>
